:: Widgets MP Guild Assembly [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpGuildInit">>
<<if !$mpGuildStanding>><<set $mpGuildStanding to {}>><</if>>
<<for _jKey range ["bakery", "cafe", "fish", "spa", "farm", "clock", "laundry", "tailor", "courier", "pubkitchen", "stable", "trawler", "docks", "crafts", "service", "underground"]>>
	<<if $mpGuildStanding[_jKey] is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding[_jKey] to 0>><</if>>
<</for>>
<<if $mpGuildStanding.wageMod is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to 100>><</if>>
<<if $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod to 0>><</if>>
<<if $mpGuildStanding.tollMod is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding.tollMod to 0>><</if>>
<<if !$mpGuildStanding.policy>><<set $mpGuildStanding.policy to "none">><</if>>
<<if $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay is undefined>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to 0>><</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpGuildAdd">>
<<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _jKey to (_args[0] or "bakery")>>
<<set _amt to (_args[1] or 5)>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding[_jKey] to Math.min(100, Math.max(0, ($mpGuildStanding[_jKey] or 0) + _amt))>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.docks to Math.min(100, Math.round((($mpGuildStanding.fish or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.trawler or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.pubkitchen or 0)) / 3))>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.crafts to Math.min(100, Math.round((($mpGuildStanding.bakery or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.clock or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.tailor or 0)) / 3))>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.service to Math.min(100, Math.round((($mpGuildStanding.cafe or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.spa or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.laundry or 0)) / 3))>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.underground to Math.min(100, Math.round((($mpGuildStanding.courier or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.farm or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.stable or 0)) / 3))>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpGuildVote">>
<<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _bill to (_args[0] or "wage")>>
<<set _stance to (_args[1] or "pass")>>
<<if _bill is "wage">><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to (_stance is "pass" ? 115 : 95)>><</if>>
<<if _bill is "curfew">><<set $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod to (_stance is "relax" ? 2 : -1)>><</if>>
<<if _bill is "toll">><<set $mpGuildStanding.tollMod to (_stance is "cut" ? -8 : 10)>><</if>>
<</widget>>
<<widget "mpGuildPolicy">>
<<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _pol to (_args[0] or "charter")>>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.policy to _pol>>
<</widget>>

:: MP Guild Assembly Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _gSeats to []>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Bakery_1 or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("面包房")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Cafe_1 or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobCafeLevel or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("咖啡馆")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Fish_1 or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("鱼档")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Spa_1 or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobSpaLevel or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("浴场")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Farm_1 or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobFarmLevel or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("农庄")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Clock_1 or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("钟表铺")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Laundry_1 or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobLaundryLevel or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("洗衣房")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Tailor_1 or 0) gte 1 or ($mpJobTailorLevel or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("裁缝铺")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Courier_1 or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("信差站")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("酒馆后厨")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Stable_1 or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("马厩")>><</if>>
<<if ($mpJobReg_Trawler_1 or 0) gte 1>><<run _gSeats.push("拖网船")>><</if>>
<<set _factionOpen to ((_gSeats.length gte 4) or (($mpStanding and ($mpStanding.guilds or 0)) gte 10) or ($mpGuildStanding.policy neq "none"))>>
<<set _voteOpen to ((_gSeats.length gte 1) or (($mpStanding and ($mpStanding.guilds or 0)) gte 5) or ($mpGuildStanding.policy neq "none"))>>
十二行会联席厅设在旧海关钟楼三层，长窗正对着灰雾未散的海面。十二张窄桌围成一圈，中央厚账册记着现行章程：工钱倍率 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%，宵禁修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>>，港税修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>>，总章程<<if $mpGuildEnded>>已封存「<<print $mpWorldGuildOutcome>>」定本<<elseif $mpGuildStanding.policy is "charter">>已立「百工宪章」<<elseif $mpGuildStanding.policy is "freeport">>已结「自由港盟约」<<elseif $mpGuildStanding.policy is "shadow">>已归「影子议会」<<else>>尚未落印<</if>>（下轮唱票日：第 <<print $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay>> 日）。执事说坐满的椅子才有份量。
<<if _voteOpen>>
廊台肯把话递进来，椅子上坐的都是你替它跑过腿的铺子。
<<else>>
廊台仍旧空着，执事说先得在铺面里真正跑满一班，椅子才肯记住你。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|MP Town Side Stories Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[问席位门路 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<if _factionOpen>><<shopicon>><<link [[查看四大派系 (0:04)|MP Guild Bloc Overview]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if _voteOpen>><<mpscaleicon>><<link [[走上中央议事桌 (0:04)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if _voteOpen and $mpGuildStanding.policy neq "none">><<mplettericon>><<link [[进后墙文书房别册 (0:03)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Guild Bloc Overview [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
四面高背廊台分属海港、百工、侍奉与暗流四帮，廊柱上挂着船锚、铁锤、酒盏与车轮旧旗。眼下海港席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.docks>>、百工 <<print $mpGuildStanding.crafts>>、侍奉 <<print $mpGuildStanding.service>>、暗流 <<print $mpGuildStanding.underground>>。百工重工钱与本地货，侍奉重晚班钟点，海港争泊位与闸税，暗流盯夜路门牌。你可走访各铺拉票；终局章程要四帮席位攒够、手里还得有一笔落印底金或已立过一份法案，执事才肯把铜印递过来。
<br><br>
<<set _guildBlocSum to (($mpGuildStanding.crafts or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.docks or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.service or 0) + ($mpGuildStanding.underground or 0))>>
<<set _guildEndStance to (_guildBlocSum gte 20 or (($mpStanding and ($mpStanding.guilds or 0)) gte 10))>>
<<set _guildEndResource to (($money or 0) gte 200 or ($mpGuildStanding.policy neq "none"))>>
<<set _guildEndOpen to (_guildEndStance and _guildEndResource)>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if not ($daily and $daily.mpGuildBlocVisit)>><<mphandshakeicon>><<link [[走访各铺院 (0:12)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "cafe" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" 9>><<tiredness 2>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpGuildBlocVisit to 1>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpGuildEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldGuildOutcome is "charter">><<mplettericon>><<link [[重温百工宪章 (0:06)|MP Guild Ending Charter]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<elseif $mpWorldGuildOutcome is "freeport">><<docksicon>><<link [[重温自由港盟约 (0:06)|MP Guild Ending FreePort]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<sneakicon>><<link [[重温影子议会夜账 (0:06)|MP Guild Ending Shadow]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<<elseif _guildEndOpen>>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[签署百工宪章 (0:15)|MP Guild Ending Charter]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<docksicon>><<link [[缔结自由港盟约 (0:15)|MP Guild Ending FreePort]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br>
<<link [[成立地下影子议会 (0:15)|MP Guild Ending Shadow]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<else>>
<span class="disabled">签署宪章 / 自由港 / 影子议会 (0:15)（需四帮席位合计≥20或行会声望≥10，且持有£2.00底金或已立法案）</span><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[先去中央议桌立法案 (0:04)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Guild Bill Wage [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
工钱案卷摊在铜尺下，现行倍率 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%，百工席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.crafts>>。面包房与裁缝铺代表主张把学徒工钱上调至一百一十五成，免得手艺人被寒潮逼走；鱼档与信差代表则担心人工抬高会压垮小本买卖，主张压在九十五成。执事敲响木槌等你投下决定票。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回中央议桌 (0:02)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[表决上调工钱 (0:12)|MP Guild Bill Wage After]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<if $daily.mpGuildWageFail>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "wage_fail">><<stress 2>><<elseif Time.days gte ($mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay or 0) and ($mpGuildStanding.crafts gte 6 or ($maths or 0) gte 220)>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 3>><<mpGuildVote "wage" "pass">><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "cafe" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" -9>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" -6>><<stress -2>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "wage_up">><<else>><<set $daily.mpGuildWageFail to 1>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 3>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" -4>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" -2>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "wage_fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[支持维持各铺原薪 (0:10)|MP Guild Bill Wage After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 3>><<mpGuildVote "wage" "hold">><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" -9>><<mpGuildAdd "cafe" -6>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" 4>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "wage_hold">><</link>>

:: MP Guild Bill Wage After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<if $mpGuildBillRes is "wage_up">>
百工帮代表齐声附议，工钱倍率正式写入一百一十五成。面包房与钟表铺的学徒当晚便领到了足额贴补，全城打散工的实得酬劳随之抬升。
<<stress -3>>
<<elseif $mpGuildBillRes is "wage_hold">>
东家与船主代表占了上风，工钱倍率锁在九十五成。铺面虽然省下了开销，但廊台下的学徒们纷纷把号牌翻了过去。
<<stress 1>>
<<else>>
百工席位不足且账目核算被当场驳回，加薪案未能过堂，议事厅里吵成一团，本轮表决分文未发。
<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
钟楼三层的长窗外海雾翻涌，铜尺下的羊皮账页散着淡淡的旧墨味。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回中央议桌 (0:02)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回十二行会总枢 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Bill Curfew [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
执事把黄铜怀表搁在宵禁案卷旁：现行营业窗为 <<mpWorldScheduleOpen 8 21>>，宵禁修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>>，侍奉席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.service>>。咖啡馆与浴场掌柜希望把夜禁往后放宽两个钟点，好接纳晚班散工的熟客；钟表铺与巡夜代表则主张提前收紧夜巡。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回中央议桌 (0:02)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[表决放宽夜禁 (0:12)|MP Guild Bill Curfew After]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<if $daily.mpGuildCurfewFail>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "curfew_fail">><<stress 2>><<elseif Time.days gte ($mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay or 0) and ($mpGuildStanding.service gte 6 or ($english or 0) gte 220)>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 4>><<mpGuildVote "curfew" "relax">><<mpGuildAdd "spa" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" -6>><<mpGuildAdd "pubkitchen" -6>><<stress -2>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "curfew_relax">><<else>><<set $daily.mpGuildCurfewFail to 1>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 4>><<mpGuildAdd "spa" -4>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" -2>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "curfew_fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpfist2icon>><<link [[支持收紧夜巡钟点 (0:10)|MP Guild Bill Curfew After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 4>><<mpGuildVote "curfew" "tight">><<mpGuildAdd "clock" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "spa" -9>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" -9>><<mpFameAdd "combat" 3>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "curfew_tight">><</link>>

:: MP Guild Bill Curfew After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<if $mpGuildBillRes is "curfew_relax">>
侍奉帮掌柜纷纷举牌，全城营业钟点向后顺延两格。高街与码头的灯火得以多亮一个时辰，夜归人也有了落脚喝热汤的地方。
<<stress -3>>
<<elseif $mpGuildBillRes is "curfew_tight">>
收紧夜巡的条款落槌通过，街面打烊钟点提前了一格。巡夜哨卡查验更严，但各铺面的夜间损耗也随之压低。
<<stress 1>>
<<else>>
侍奉席位单薄，放宽夜禁的动议被守旧席位联手压下，长案上的怀表照旧点走字，未发分毫贴补。
<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
钟楼三层的长窗外海雾翻涌，铜尺下的羊皮账页散着淡淡的旧墨味。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回中央议桌 (0:02)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回十二行会总枢 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Bill Toll [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
税吏用铁秤砣压住闸口账页：当前百钱物价折算为 <<mpWorldPrice 100>>，港税修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>>，海港席位 <<print $mpGuildStanding.docks>>。拖网船主与酒馆后厨要求减免过闸税以平抑全城物价；裁缝铺与信差站则主张加征护港费修补防波堤。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回中央议桌 (0:02)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[表决减免港税 (0:12)|MP Guild Bill Toll After]]>><<pass 12>><<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>><<if $daily.mpGuildTollFail>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "toll_fail">><<stress 2>><<elseif Time.days gte ($mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay or 0) and ($mpGuildStanding.docks gte 6 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220)>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 3>><<mpGuildVote "toll" "cut">><<mpGuildAdd "trawler" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "cafe" 6>><<mpGuildAdd "tailor" -9>><<mpGuildAdd "stable" -6>><<stress -2>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "toll_cut">><<else>><<set $daily.mpGuildTollFail to 1>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 3>><<mpGuildAdd "trawler" -4>><<mpStandingAdd "docks" -2>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "toll_fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[支持加征护港闸费 (0:10)|MP Guild Bill Toll After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 3>><<mpGuildVote "toll" "raise">><<mpGuildAdd "tailor" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "courier" 9>><<mpGuildAdd "trawler" -6>><<mpGuildAdd "laundry" -6>><<mpStandingAdd "docks" 4>><<set $mpGuildBillRes to "toll_raise">><</link>>

:: MP Guild Bill Toll After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<if $mpGuildBillRes is "toll_cut">>
海港帮船主拍案叫好，过闸税立减八文。外海渔获与干柴连夜顺畅进港，街面采买物价应声回落。
<<stress -3>>
<<elseif $mpGuildBillRes is "toll_raise">>
加征护港费的条款写进木牌，每担过闸费上浮十文。防波堤修缮有了专款，只是城里日用百货的价签也跟着涨了一截。
<<stress 1>>
<<else>>
海港席位不够份量，减税提案被税吏当场驳回，闸口铁链照旧落锁，本轮没有半点贴补。
<<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
钟楼三层的长窗外海雾翻涌，铜尺下的羊皮账页散着淡淡的旧墨味。你定下心神，将手头的器物与册页再次核对妥当。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回中央议桌 (0:02)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回十二行会总枢 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Ending Charter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<if !$mpGuildEnded>><<set $mpGuildEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldGuildOutcome to "charter">><<set $mpGuildStanding.tollMod to Math.min(15, ($mpGuildStanding.tollMod or 0) + 4)>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" 10>><<mpStandingAdd "docks" -3>><</if>><<mpGuildPolicy "charter">>
《百工宪章》在钟楼三层正式盖下十二铜印，将工钱倍率 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%、宵禁修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>> 与港税修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>> 钉进同一本总册。百工帮坐上首席，侍奉帮拿到常设席位，全城百钱物价折算为 <<mpWorldPrice 100>>，十二行学徒的班次与工钱从此有了明文凭据。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回行会总枢 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -5>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回看四大派系总览 (0:04)|MP Guild Bloc Overview]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Ending FreePort [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<if !$mpGuildEnded>><<set $mpGuildEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldGuildOutcome to "freeport">><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to Math.max(90, ($mpGuildStanding.wageMod or 100) - 5)>><<mpStandingAdd "docks" 10>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" -3>><</if>><<mpGuildPolicy "freeport">>
《自由港盟约》由港务所与海港帮联署生效。工钱倍率停在 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%，宵禁修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>>，港税修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>>，全城百钱实付 <<mpWorldPrice 100>>。三号栈桥与内河泊位向夜航船敞开，雾夜卸货不再受繁琐查验掣肘，海港旗帜高悬在钟楼外廊。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回行会总枢 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -5>><</link>><br>
<<docksicon>><<link [[回看四大派系总览 (0:04)|MP Guild Bloc Overview]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Ending Shadow [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<if !$mpGuildEnded>><<set $mpGuildEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldGuildOutcome to "shadow">><<set $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod to Math.min(4, ($mpGuildStanding.curfewMod or 0) + 2)>><<mpStandingAdd "underworld" 10>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" -4>><</if>><<mpGuildPolicy "shadow">>
《影子议会夜账》在钟楼背光处悄然落印。明面上的工钱倍率仍是 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%、宵禁修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.curfewMod>>、港税修正 <<print $mpGuildStanding.tollMod>>，但真正管事的换成了暗流煤窖里的门牌册。全城百钱实付 <<mpWorldPrice 100>>，夜路急件与暗桩车马从此通行无阻。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回行会总枢 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -5>><</link>><br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[回看四大派系总览 (0:04)|MP Guild Bloc Overview]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Vote Desk [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
议事桌从厅中央抬了出来，工钱簿、宵禁簿与闸口账并排压在铜尺下。<<if $mpWorldGuildQuarterLocked>>季度联席法典早已落印封存，本季不再开新案；执事把旧卷推到一边，只留下工钱、宵禁与闸口三本常账，四面的廊台也静了下来。<<else>>铜尺下还压着一份新拟的季度联席统筹草案，四帮都在等有人领衔唱票。<</if>>
钟楼三层的长窗外海雾翻涌，铜尺下的羊皮账页散着淡淡的旧墨味。<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[表决工钱案 (0:08)|MP Guild Bill Wage]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[表决宵禁钟点 (0:08)|MP Guild Bill Curfew]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[表决闸口港税案 (0:08)|MP Guild Bill Toll]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<if not ($mpWorldGuildQuarterLocked or 0)>><<link [[启动季度联席法案 (0:10)|MP Guild Quarter Proposal]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Guild Quarter Proposal [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<set $mpGuildQStanceDocks to ($mpGuildQStanceDocks or 0)>><<set $mpGuildQStanceCrafts to ($mpGuildQStanceCrafts or 0)>><<set $mpGuildQStanceService to ($mpGuildQStanceService or 0)>><<set $mpGuildQStanceUnder to ($mpGuildQStanceUnder or 0)>>
执事将本季《四帮联席统筹草案》摊在长案正中。草案旁压着一张水尺抄件，记着雾潮已到 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格；另一角是神殿送来的香油封样，落款写着<<if $mpTempleOrder is "orthodox">>净火正统<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "reform">>慈悲圣所<<elseif $mpTempleOrder is "concord">>双生调和<<else>>中立执事<</if>>。要让草案过堂，须先去四面廊台听取海港、百工、侍奉与暗流的表态。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回议桌 (0:02)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<docksicon>><<link [[听海港表态 (0:08)|MP Guild Quarter Docks]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[听百工帮表态 (0:08)|MP Guild Quarter Crafts]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[听侍奉与暗流声 (0:08)|MP Guild Quarter Service]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<link [[直接开启联席唱票 (0:12)|MP Guild Quarter Vote]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Quarter Vote [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _supportCnt to (($mpGuildQStanceDocks or 0) + ($mpGuildQStanceCrafts or 0) + ($mpGuildQStanceService or 0) + ($mpGuildQStanceUnder or 0))>>
钟楼三层的铜铃敲响三下，十二席代表围坐长案正式对季度联席法案唱票。账房高声报出当前四帮附议票数：已获附议 <<print _supportCnt>> 帮，雾潮联动水尺 <<print ($mpFogTide or 0)>> 格。<<if _supportCnt gte 2>>两帮附议已够门槛，随时可落印铸定季度法典。<<elseif ($mpGuildStanding.crafts or 0) gte 10>>百工席位已厚，可由百工领衔附署落印。<<else>>目前附议不足两帮，百工席位也还单薄，强行表决恐遭搁置。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回提案 (0:02)|MP Guild Quarter Proposal]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[当众落槌表决 (0:14)|MP Guild Quarter Outcome]]>><<pass 14>><<if _supportCnt gte 2 or ($mpGuildStanding.crafts or 0) gte 10>><<set $mpGuildQVoteRes to "pass">><<else>><<set $mpGuildQVoteRes to "fail">><</if>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[申请暂缓搁置议案 (0:08)|MP Guild Quarter Soft End]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Quarter Outcome [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<set _qCnt to (($mpGuildQStanceDocks or 0) + ($mpGuildQStanceCrafts or 0) + ($mpGuildQStanceService or 0) + ($mpGuildQStanceUnder or 0))>>
<<if $mpGuildQVoteRes isnot "pass">>
<<set $mpGuildStanding.nextBillDay to Time.days + 2>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" -3>><<mpGuildAdd "bakery" -3>><<mpGuildAdd "fish" -3>>四帮廊台的附议票数未能过半，海港与暗流代表当场合上账册起身离席。执事收起红泥印盒，记下你的行会威望折损，宣布本轮季度联席草案搁置并需隔日再议。
<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>>
<<else>>
<<if not ($mpWorldGuildQuarterLocked or 0)>><<set $mpWorldGuildQuarterLocked to 1>><<set $mpGuildQuarterLaw to "enacted">><<set $mpGuildStanding.wageMod to Math.min(125, ($mpGuildStanding.wageMod or 100) + 5)>><<set $mpWorldPriceMod to Math.max(85, ($mpWorldPriceMod or 100) - 3)>><<mpStandingAdd "guilds" 8>><<stress -6>><</if>>
<<if _qCnt gte 2>>附议的两帮各按一枚帮印上羊皮卷<<else>>百工席位已厚，由百工领衔附署<</if>>，季度联席法典就此落印，往后的季度不再改判。雾潮航道补贴与神殿夜班津贴一并折进物价，全城百钱实付按 <<mpWorldPrice 100>> 结算，十二行工钱倍率落在 <<print $mpGuildStanding.wageMod>>%。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("guild_quarter_law_v47")>><<money 1200>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回议桌 (0:03)|MP Guild Vote Desk]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<shopicon>><<link [[回看十二行会总枢 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Guild Quarter Soft End [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<mpGuildInit>>
<<if $mpGuildQVoteRes is "pass">>
季度联席法典已经正式落印生效，文书偏厢里的旧草案卷宗全部归档封存。执事给你倒了一杯热茶，说往后只需按新法典核对各行工钱与闸口账目即可。
<<else>>
你走出嘈杂的联席厅，在钟楼三层的文书偏厢稍作休整。本轮季度法案表决暂时搁置，未发分毫酬劳；先前在四帮廊台谈妥的附议意向海港 <<print ($mpGuildQStanceDocks or 0)>>、百工 <<print ($mpGuildQStanceCrafts or 0)>>、侍奉 <<print ($mpGuildQStanceService or 0)>>、暗流 <<print ($mpGuildQStanceUnder or 0)>> 均已记录在册。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总枢 (0:02)|MP Guild Assembly Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if $mpGuildQVoteRes isnot "pass">><<mpscaleicon>><<link [[重返提案长案 (0:04)|MP Guild Quarter Proposal]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[转往文书别册查卷 (0:04)|MP Guild Assembly More Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
